{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27932","headline":"羽林郎 · 朱庆余","name":"羽林郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫髯年少奉恩初，直合将军尽不如。\n酒後引兵围百草，风前驻斾领边书。\n宅将公主同时赐，官与中郎共日除。\n大笑鲁儒年四十，腰间犹未识金鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}